   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C13-010",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "因念道：三春过后诸芳尽，各自须寻各自门。",
  "title": "三春过后诸芳尽",
  "actions": [
