 },
 {
  "chapter": "c13-assist",
  "scene": "c13_funeral",
  "place": "宁国府 · 上房",
  "focus": "room",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 13,
   "paragraphLead": "可巧这日非正经日期",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C13-081",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "贾珍此时也有些病症在身，二则过于悲痛了，因拄个拐踱了进来。邢夫人等因说道：“你身上不好，又连日事多，该歇歇才是，又进来做什么？”",
  "title": "因拄个拐踱了进来",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "show",
    "actor": "jia_zhen",
    "at": "room"
   },
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "jia_zhen",
